              "Static file reloads"
            ],
            [
              "IntelliJ Live Edit",
              "Deep IDE integration",
              "Limited to specific IDEs",
              "Real-time changes in supported files"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 63,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "conclusion",
      "heading": "Conclusion",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Spring Boot DevTools is a powerful tool that boosts development efficiency by automating restarts and offering live reloads. However, understanding its limitations and choosing the right tool for your environment is critical for success."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "text": "Use DevTools for local dev. For production, stick to manual and controlled deployments."
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 47,
      "subsections": []
    },
